# Supabase (optional): when set, content rows in Supabase override the
# bundled data. Create a project at https://supabase.com, run
# supabase/schema.sql + supabase/seed.sql in its SQL Editor, then copy
# Project Settings -> API values here (and into Vercel env vars).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
